\n- 1 Bag\n- 2 Golf Balls\n\nAmerican Football themed gear landing in the store in time for kickoff 9/3!\n- 2 Bags\n- 1 Golf Ball\n- Headcovers: 2 Driver & Woods, 1 Blade, 1 Mallet, 1 Center Shafted\n\n### Course Updates:\n- Corrected flags near the Royal Dornoch Clubhouse.\n- Addressed visual streaks when playing out of bunkers at Royal Dornoch.\n- Adjusted the lighting on tee box at Bay Hill to help with the Foveated Rendering areas.\n", "created_date": 1786566948, "id": "27718649857803731", "version": "813.01", "version_code": 150271, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 33}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27718649857803731"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786562407, "id": "27718001687868548", "version": "813.01", "version_code": 150268, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 33}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27718649857803731"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786556919, "id": "27717060334629350", "version": "813.01", "version_code": 150267, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"cou